{"unit_id": "tag:01ZU:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节汇集一些关于在一般程度不同的情形下仿射开集（affine opens）存在的结果。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指这些存在性结果所讨论的开集"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01ZV:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拟分离（quasi-separated）概形（scheme）。\n设<MATH_0002>为两两不同的不可约分支（irreducible components），它们是<MATH_0003>的不可约分支，见《拓扑（Topology）》第<REF_0001>节。\n设<MATH_0004>为它们的泛点（generic points），见《概形（Schemes）》的引理<REF_0002>。\n存在仿射开（affine open）邻域（neighbourhoods）<MATH_0005>，使得<MATH_0006>对所有<MATH_0007>都成立。\n特别地，<MATH_0008>是包含所有点（points）<MATH_0009>的仿射开集（affine open）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "generic points", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhoods", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "描述引理对概形的假设"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指引理所研究的对象"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "指所选的两两不同的分支"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "指不可约分支相关小节所在章"}, {"source_term": "generic points", "target_term": "泛点", "context": "指相应不可约分支的泛点"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指泛点相关引理所在章"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开", "context": "描述所选邻域是仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhoods", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "指为各泛点选取的邻域"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "指结论中的所有指定点"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指包含所有指定点的开集"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01ZV:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为任意包含<MATH_0002>且与闭（closed）集（set）<MATH_0003>不交（disjoint）的仿射开集（affine open）。\n由于<MATH_0004>是拟分离（quasi-separated）的，对每个<MATH_0005>，并集（union）\n<MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>中不包含<MATH_0008>的拟紧开集（quasi-compact open）。\n可以找到开邻域（open neighbourhoods）<MATH_0009>，它们包含<MATH_0010>且与<MATH_0011>不交（disjoint），这可由《代数（Algebra）》的引理<REF_0001>得到。\n最后，<MATH_0012>是仿射（affine）的，因为它是环（ring）<MATH_0013>的谱（spectrum），其中<MATH_0014>，见《概形（Schemes）》的引理<REF_0002>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集"}, {"source_term": "disjoint", "target_term": "不交"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并集"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhoods", "target_term": "开邻域"}, {"source_term": "disjoint", "target_term": "不交"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭", "context": "描述需避开的集合"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集", "context": "与闭合用表示闭集"}, {"source_term": "disjoint", "target_term": "不交", "context": "说明所选仿射开集避开该闭集"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指任取的仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "用于得到所论开集的拟紧性"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并集", "context": "指公式给出的集合并"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集", "context": "指不含指定点的开集"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhoods", "target_term": "开邻域", "context": "指用代数引理选取的邻域"}, {"source_term": "disjoint", "target_term": "不交", "context": "说明这些开邻域避开指定集合"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target