{"unit_id": "tag:01ZU:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n尽管有上面的例子，至少在以下情形中，对于由不可约（irreducible）闭子集（closed subsets）组成的“大多数”有限集合（finite sets），仍可应用上述引理<REF_0001>，即<MATH_0001>为拟紧（quasi-compact）时。这是因为<MATH_0002>包含一个分离（separated）的稠密开集（dense open）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "finite sets", "target_term": "有限集合"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "dense open", "target_term": "稠密开集"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约", "context": "修饰所考虑的闭子集"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "指有限集合的成员"}, {"source_term": "finite sets", "target_term": "有限集合", "context": "指由若干不可约闭子集组成的集合"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "指陈述适用的概形条件"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "指所含稠密开集的性质"}, {"source_term": "dense open", "target_term": "稠密开集", "context": "指用于解释引理适用性的开集"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03J1:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拟紧（quasi-compact）概形（scheme）。\n存在一个分离（separated）的稠密开集（dense open）<MATH_0002>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "dense open", "target_term": "稠密开集"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "指引理对概形的假设"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指引理所研究的对象"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "指引理保证的稠密开集的性质"}, {"source_term": "dense open", "target_term": "稠密开集", "context": "指引理断言存在的开集"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03J1:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>个仿射开（affine open）子概形（subschemes）的并集（union）。我们对<MATH_0003>作归纳（induction）来证明这条引理。<MATH_0004>时结论是平凡的。设<MATH_0005>为一个分离（separated）的稠密开子概形（dense open subscheme），其存在性由归纳假设（induction hypothesis）给出。考虑\n<MATH_0006>\n显然，<MATH_0007>是分离（separated）的，也是<MATH_0008>的稠密开子概形（dense open subscheme）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "subschemes", "target_term": "子概形"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并集"}, {"source_term": "induction", "target_term": "归纳"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "dense open subscheme", "target_term": "稠密开子概形"}, {"source_term": "induction hypothesis", "target_term": "归纳假设"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "dense open subscheme", "target_term": "稠密开子概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开", "context": "修饰组成该并集的子概形"}, {"source_term": "subschemes", "target_term": "子概形", "context": "指组成该并集的仿射开子概形"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并集", "context": "指这些仿射开子概形的并"}, {"source_term": "induction", "target_term": "归纳", "context": "证明对给定量作归纳"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "指归纳假设给出的子概形的性质"}, {"source_term": "dense open subscheme", "target_term": "稠密开子概形", "context": "指归纳假设给出的子概形"}, {"source_term": "induction hypothesis", "target_term": "归纳假设", "context": "用于给出所选子概形的存在性"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "指最后构造出的子概形的性质"}, {"source_term": "dense open subscheme", "target_term": "稠密开子概形", "context": "指最后构造所得子概形"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01ZU:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n事实上，即使<MATH_0001>既是拟分离（quasi-separated）的又是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，也可能不存在同时分离（separated）且拟紧（quasi-compact）的稠密开集（dense open），见《例子（Examples）》的引理<REF_0001>。\n下面对上述引理<REF_0002>略作细化。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "dense open", "target_term": "稠密开集"}, {"source_term": "Examples", "target_term": "例子"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "指反例中仍满足的分离性条件"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "指反例中仍满足的紧性条件"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "指所讨论的稠密开集应有的分离性"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "指所讨论的稠密开集应有的紧性"}, {"source_term": "dense open", "target_term": "稠密开集", "context": "指同时要求分离和拟紧的开集"}, {"source_term": "Examples", "target_term": "例子", "context": "指所引反例所在章"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01ZX:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拟分离（quasi-separated）概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为两两不同的不可约分支（irreducible components），均取自<MATH_0003>。设<MATH_0004>为它们的泛点（generic points）。任取<MATH_0005>。\n存在一个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0006>，包含<MATH_0007>及所有的<MATH_0008>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "generic points", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "指引理对概形的假设"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指引理所研究的对象"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "指所选的两两不同的分支"}, {"source_term": "generic points", "target_term": "泛点", "context": "指这些不可约分支的泛点"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指引理断言存在的开集"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01ZX:proof", "translation": "假设<MATH_0001>且<MATH_0002>。于是可以选取仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0003>，使得<MATH_0004>，且<MATH_0005>对<MATH_0006>成立。注意，显然<MATH_0007>对<MATH_0008>成立。由引理<REF_0001>，可选取两两不交（pairwise disjoint）的仿射开集（affine opens）<MATH_0009>，使得<MATH_0010>对<MATH_0011>成立。\n由于<MATH_0012>是拟分离（quasi-separated）的，开集（opens）<MATH_0013>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，且不包含<MATH_0014>，后者对<MATH_0015>成立。因此，由《代数（Algebra）》的引理<REF_0002>，可以缩小<MATH_0016>，使得<MATH_0017>对<MATH_0018>成立。于是，并集（union）<MATH_0019>的各项互不相交（disjoint），故由《概形（Schemes）》的引理<REF_0003>可知，它是一个符合要求的仿射开集（affine open）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "pairwise disjoint", "target_term": "两两不交"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并集"}, {"source_term": "disjoint", "target_term": "互不相交"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指证明中首先选取的开集"}, {"source_term": "pairwise disjoint", "target_term": "两两不交", "context": "指用前一引理选出的开集之间的关系"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指用前一引理选出的开集"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "指用于推出所涉开集拟紧的假设"}, {"source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集", "context": "指用拟分离性验证拟紧的开集"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "指应用代数引理所用的开集性质"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指缩小开集所引引理所在章"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并集", "context": "指最后构造出的开集的并"}, {"source_term": "disjoint", "target_term": "互不相交", "context": "指最后所取并集的各项之间的关系"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "cont